          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Buy gas when your lawn is large, the grass is thick or often overgrown, or you want to mow without worrying about battery runtime. Choose a push mower for small, flat lawns and a self-propelled model, with rear-wheel drive for hills, for anything larger. The Toro Recycler and Super Recycler are the standouts, while the Craftsman M115 and Troy-Bilt TB110 cover tight budgets.
          </p>
